
Gary-

 Yes, I use Puma with Telix.  Here are my batch files:

 Upload:

 puma s%1 p%2 s %3 %4 %5 %6 %7 %8 %9

 Download:

 puma s%1 p%2 r c:\telix\files\

----

 I use the setup program to enable fast handshaking, and logging.
You can put the speed and port settings in the setup program, too, and
take out the "s%1 p%2" settings if you wish...

-- Matt Thomas --
